sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant UI as Mock Interview UI (src/app/(app)/interview/page.tsx)
    participant InterviewRouter as Interview Router (app/routers/interview.py)
    participant InterviewSvc as Interview Service (app/services/interview.py)
    participant RAG as RAG Context Search (app/services/rag.py)
    participant LLM as Gemini LLM Service (Strong Model)
    participant ReadinessSvc as Readiness Engine (app/services/readiness_data.py)
    participant DB as Database (interviews, readiness_scores)

    Student->>UI: Selects Company (Amazon), Role (SDE), Type (Technical)
    UI->>InterviewRouter: POST /api/v1/interviews
    InterviewRouter->>InterviewSvc: start_interview(user_id, company_id, role, type)
    InterviewSvc->>RAG: search(company + role + "interview questions", k=2)
    RAG-->>InterviewSvc: Relevant Interview Context
    InterviewSvc->>LLM: structured(task="interview_start", schema=OpeningQuestionOut)
    LLM-->>InterviewSvc: opening_question + topic_focus
    InterviewSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO interviews (status='in_progress', transcript=[opening])
    InterviewSvc-->>InterviewRouter: Interview Session Record
    InterviewRouter-->>UI: Render Opening Question & Active Chat Console

    loop Multi-Turn Interaction (Turns 1 to 4)
        Student->>UI: Types Written Response & Submits
        UI->>InterviewRouter: POST /api/v1/interviews/{id}/turn {student_answer}
        InterviewRouter->>InterviewSvc: submit_turn(user_id, interview_id, answer)
        InterviewSvc->>InterviewSvc: Append student response to transcript
        InterviewSvc->>LLM: structured(task="interview_turn", schema=TurnFollowUpOut)
        Note over LLM: Evaluates previous answer briefly,<br/>synthesizes probing follow-up.<br/>Suggests finish if turn >= 4.
        LLM-->>InterviewSvc: evaluation_snippet + follow_up_question + suggest_finish
        InterviewSvc->>DB: Update interviews.transcript
        InterviewSvc-->>InterviewRouter: Updated Session
        InterviewRouter-->>UI: Render Follow-Up Question & Evaluation Snippet
    end

    Student->>UI: Clicks "Finish Interview" (or suggested wrap-up)
    UI->>InterviewRouter: POST /api/v1/interviews/{id}/finish
    InterviewRouter->>InterviewSvc: finish_interview(user_id, interview_id)
    InterviewSvc->>LLM: structured(task="evaluate_interview", schema=InterviewEvaluationOut)
    Note over LLM: Evaluates 5-Dimension Rubric (Scale 1-10):<br/>1. Technical Knowledge<br/>2. Problem Solving<br/>3. Communication (written)<br/>4. Confidence (written)<br/>5. Concept Accuracy
    LLM-->>InterviewSvc: Rubric Scores, Strengths, Weaknesses, Recommended Topics, Summary
    
    Note over InterviewSvc: Scaled Score Calculation:<br/>avg_score_10 = sum(5 dims) / 5.0<br/>overall_score = avg_score_10 * 10 (Scale 0-100)
    InterviewSvc->>DB: UPDATE interviews SET status='completed', scores=?, report=?, ended_at=utcnow()
    
    Note over ReadinessSvc: Dynamic Feedback Loop:<br/>readiness_data.py reads completed interviews.<br/>Equation 3.1 Interview component = average overall_score!
    
    InterviewSvc-->>InterviewRouter: Completed Interview Analysis View
    InterviewRouter-->>UI: Render 5-Dimension Radar/Scores, Strengths, and Detailed Feedback
